WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:06.465
♪ Can you see? ♪

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:08.634
- There are days in every child's life

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:10.886
that change who they are forever.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:13.138
- (exclaiming)

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:15.140
- This is the extraordinary story...

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.352
...of how we learn to talk...

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:19.144
- Ba ba!

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:21.063
-  (both babbling)

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:21.813
- ...think...

00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:23.065
- What's that, Mommy?

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:24.900
- It's a doggy.
- Why?

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.527
- Why?
- Why, Daddy?

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:27.528
- ...and love.

00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:28.570
- This is your new baby brother.

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:31.323
♪ ...listens ♪

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.200
♪ Rising within me ♪

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.993
- From the moment we're born,

00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:36.995
to when we turn five.

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:41.708
♪ We're flyin' higher ♪

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:43.418
- Wee wee! Five.

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:45.546
- Hello, Mommy. How are you?

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:50.008
♪ We're flying high ♪

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:53.470
♪ It's a good day for dreaming ♪

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:56.807
- The first 2,000 days of life

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:01.395
told through the eyes
of 100 children around the world.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:06.400
- (in Japanese) Ready, set, go!
- (shouting)

00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:10.654
♪ It's a good day for dreaming ♪

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:13.740
♪ There's a hope,
there's a star, there's a fire ♪

00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:16.785
♪ There's a light in the dark
where it's brighter ♪

00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:19.204
- When I grow up,
I want to be an astronaut.

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:21.415
- Teacher.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:27.379
♪ It's a good day for dreaming ♪

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.631
- Say ma-ma.

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:32.676
- Da-da.
- No! Ma-ma-mummy!

